{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261128/photo/bkn-20261128072215914-1128_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261128120141\"/><p>上水坑頭村6旬男身懷兩仿製槍械被捕。</p><p>今日(28日)凌晨3時53分，上水坑頭村村民報案，指一名男子形迹可疑，懷疑攜帶類似長槍的物品在村內徘徊。人員接報到場，在上址截獲該名男子，並檢獲兩把懷疑仿製槍械。經初步調查，姓梁(61歲)男子涉嫌「管有仿製槍械」被捕，他正被扣留調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T04:23:57.432425+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T23:22:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T11:11:12.195043+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T04:17:31.254629+00:00","content_hash":"2c538f7185ee90df9fbe4cd5e2f52475c59e96f7249054835e1dab6dbaa4e4ee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-28T04:23:57.432425+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}